WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:04.073
(techno music)

00:00:29.069 --> 00:00:31.701
- [Voiceover] Popole and Yolande
are two of the 10 refugees

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:35.627
selected to be a part of the
first Olympic refugee team.

00:00:35.627 --> 00:00:38.291
They will be competing in Judo.

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:41.689
They both fled conflict in the
Democratic Republic of Congo,

00:00:41.689 --> 00:00:45.856
and in the 2016 Olympics, will
compete without a country.

00:01:03.831 --> 00:01:06.731
Popole and Yolande both
sought asylum in Brazil during

00:01:06.731 --> 00:01:09.912
the Judo World Championships in 2013.

00:01:09.912 --> 00:01:12.995
They haven't seen their family since.

00:01:38.601 --> 00:01:41.391
By competing in the Olympics,
they are bringing their story

00:01:41.391 --> 00:01:43.141
to a global audience.

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:58.432
(techno music)

